[2,"The safest way to use the word 'minerality' in an exam is as:","A tasting descriptor",["Proof of a vineyard's rock type","A measure of quality","A synonym for acidity"],"It describes a sensation. Its causes are debated, and vines do not pass rock flavors into wine."]
